---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mukinge Hospital in Zambia | Community Transformation Trust" description="CT Trust provides ongoing support to Mukinge Hospital and Dr. David Friend in rural Zambia, helping keep essential medicines, including life-critical anaesthetics, on the shelves.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/projects/mukinge-hospital-zambia.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>Mukinge Hospital in Zambia</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>Ongoing</span><span>Zambia</span></div>
    <p class="detail-lead">In rural Zambia, CT Trust provides ongoing financial support to Mukinge Hospital and Dr. David Friend, helping keep essential medicines &mdash; including life-critical anaesthetics &mdash; on the shelves.</p>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Surgical care hours from the nearest city</h3>
      <p>Dr. David Friend is a surgical missionary serving a rapidly growing patient population hours from the nearest city, where a reliable supply of medicine cannot be taken for granted.</p>
      <p>Without anaesthetics, safe surgery simply cannot happen. For patients who have travelled far and have nowhere else to turn, this support is the difference between treatment and none.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/projects/mukinge-hospital-zambia.png" alt="Mukinge Hospital serving rural Zambia" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>What the funding sustains</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Essential medicines kept in stock and available.</li>
        <li>Life-critical anaesthetics that make safe surgery possible.</li>
        <li>Ongoing surgical care for a rapidly growing patient population.</li>
        <li>A trusted local institution serving a remote region.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>The lasting difference</h3>
      <p>Reliable funding keeps a rural hospital running. By supporting Mukinge Hospital, CT Trust helps ensure that people far from any city can still receive the surgical care they need.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
